carbonenginejs/tools-browser
============================

Browser-facing clients, remote readers, and application tools for
CarbonEngineJS.

CarbonEngine and Fenris Creations (CCP Games) are named for provenance,
interoperability, and target-ecosystem context. This package contains no
CarbonEngine or Fenris Creations (CCP Games) source files, tooling,
proprietary documentation, shader source, or assets.

